<title>USA: Destec gets financing for British project.</title>
<headline>Destec gets financing for British project.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Destec Energy Inc said financing had been arranged for the 140 megawatt Indian Queens power plant in Indian Queens, Cornwall, England.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement late on Monday the project financing of about $53 million was arranged and underwritten by BZW, a division of Barclays Plc</p>
<p>Indian Queens will provide electric grid stability services under a contract with the National Grid Co.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
